<title>PORTUGAL: ING buys 500,000 Mello shares.</title>
<headline>ING buys 500,000 Mello shares.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ING bought 500,000 shares of Portuguese bank Banco Mello, representing less than one percent of its 58 billion escudos capital, at 1,300 escudos per share, a Banco Mello official told Reuters. Mello shares stood at 1,280 escudos, up five, in volume of 503,050 at 1106 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
